	(text "P2: 5 BOOTSEL and 11 RUN to J5, 6 SWDIO and 10 SWCLK to J4, 7 / 9 USB D- / D+ to J2 and J3 (27R on the module).\nP2: 12 ADC_VREF and 13 3V3_EN not connected (3V3_EN open = module LDO on).\nP2.15 VBUS is the module's 5 V input (VIN, through D1); P2.16 its 3V3 output (ME6217C33 LDO), which also feeds\nM1 and M2 through JP2. GPIO39 = W5500 INTn and the module's LED1 (lit while INTn is high). No UART: debug is SWD + RTT.\nGPIO47 is the PSRAM chip select on Core2350B1 / B2 (10k pull-up R9 on the module): I2S needs the B0 module.\nGPIO18 / 44 / 46 / 47 are driven only by a firmware built for this board (feature board-one).\nAll four corner pins are GND: the module fits in four orientations, only one is right (silkscreen)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 116.84 121.92 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
				(italic yes)
				(color 70 70 70 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "edc796a4-5a07-59fb-9e02-c345166e6fec")
	)
	(text "Power: bus +5 V only; D1 to the module, F1 to the USB port"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 114.26 154.9 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2.8 2.8)
				(bold yes)
				(color 210 30 30 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "56059784-c56b-5a81-afaa-5fbb0519a866")
	)
	(text "The card is powered by the Amiga, or by the module's FPC adapter on the bench. The port never powers the card."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 114.26 160 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
				(italic yes)
				(color 210 30 30 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "55300037-5695-5c5a-8fb1-8fe3d6180768")
	)
	(text "to U1 P2.15 and M3 VIN"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 157.48 175.26 0)
		(effects
