	)
	(text "JP2 OPEN as delivered. Bridge it only on a board without U2: +3V3 (U1 P2.16,\nmodule LDO) then feeds 3V3_AUX (M1, M2). U2 is fitted by default: JP2 stays open."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 170.18 231.394 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
				(italic yes)
				(color 70 70 70 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "dbf8b849-2779-5268-b27f-cf0d5dff59de")
	)
	(text "D1 1N5817 (DO-41) keeps bench power (the module's FPC USB adapter feeds\nthe same VBUS net) off the Amiga's +5 V rail.\nF1 is all there is between the bus +5 V and the port: no series diode, no\npower switch IC. Resettable PTC, 0.9 A hold (trips at 1.8 A), 30 V or 16 V\nfamily, 5.08 mm leads: Littelfuse RUEF090 or 30R090U, Bourns MF-R090-0-9,\nLittelfuse RUSBF090. Not the 0.5 A hold parts. Footprint Bourns MF-RHT070\n(5.1 mm spacing, 1.2 mm stagger, 0.71 mm holes for 0.51 mm leads): the KiCad\nlibrary has no footprint for the parts named above. C2: the 120 uF minimum of\nUSB 2.0 7.2.4.1. The over-current fault is not reported to the host stack.\nNot protected: a hub that feeds its own 5 V back into the port reaches the\nAmiga's +5 V rail through F1, also with the Amiga switched off.\nNo extra bulk capacitance on VIN or 3V3: it would slow the 3V3 rise\nagainst the Amiga's +5 V ramp.\n\nU2 (LD1117V33, TO-220) with C3 / C4 is FITTED by default; the JLC build has U201\n(AMS1117-3.3). U2 takes the bus +5 V directly: ST guarantees 3.3 V from 4.75 V in\nat 0-800 mA (1.15 V max dropout at 500 mA). JP2 stays open (as delivered):\n3V3_AUX (M1, M2) comes from U2, the module LDO feeds only the module.\nJP2 is the fallback for a board without U2. With U2 and only bench power,\nM1 and M2 are unpowered. Never fit U2 with JP2 bridged.\nU2: GND / VOUT / VIN seen from the front, tab = VOUT, lying down.\nFits: LD1117V33, LM1117T-3.3, AZ1117T-3.3, LM1086CT-3.3, LT1086CT-3.3.\nDoes NOT fit (VIN and VOUT swapped, middle pin and tab GND): LF33CV,\nLM3940IT-3.3, MCP1825S, MCP1826S. C3 10 uF 25 V electrolytic in, C4 10 uF out.\nPWR_FLAGs (unlabelled diamonds) on +5V, VBUS_PORT, +3V3, GND: ERC only."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 200.66 166.37 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
				(italic yes)
				(color 70 70 70 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "1fd2d154-8004-57ae-bc4d-583ec260532e")
	)
	(text "Interrupt to the bus: Q1 NPN, open collector"
