		(uuid "9a8a7629-4764-518d-b05d-951f8d42a1f6")
	)
	(text "JP1 1 = /INT2 (J1 19, default)\nJP1 3 = /INT6 (J1 22)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 386.08 82.55 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
				(italic yes)
				(color 70 70 70 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "269b6977-33c4-5b6b-a9ee-bb4fc9565e74")
	)
	(text "Q1 2N3904, TO-92: emitter to GND, base through R1 (2.2k) to GPIO45, collector through JP1\nto the bus. GPIO45 resets with its pull-down on: Q1 is off while the module is in reset;\nwith the module absent the base is open and Q1 is off. A B2000 / A500+ pull the lines up\nwith 1k (5 mA); the TRM's open-collector class is 0.5 V at 8 mA. R1: (3.3 - 0.75) / 2.2k =\n1.2 mA base current; 2N3904 VCE(sat) 0.2 V max at 10 mA with 1 mA base.\nFootprint: three holes in line, base in the middle, E - B - C = pins 1 - 2 - 3.\nAs drawn (E-B-C): 2N3904, PN2222A, 2N4401, S8050. Rotated 180 degrees (C-B-E): BC547,\nBC548, BC337. Only 2N3904 and BC547 were checked against a datasheet."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 304.8 115.316 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
				(italic yes)
				(color 70 70 70 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "e3a1bf68-80d0-590d-89a3-6c449dff3e49")
	)
	(text "USB host port: J2 or J3 (fit one)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 302.22 142.2 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2.8 2.8)
				(bold yes)
				(color 200 40 110 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "5e234949-0103-5b33-b194-b48c776e7976")
	)
	(text "D+ / D- from U1 P2.9 / P2.7 (27R on the module) to J2 and J3 in parallel; only one of the two is used.\nVBUS_PORT from the bus +5 V through F1 (power block)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 302.22 147.3 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
				(italic yes)
				(color 200 40 110 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "db67b914-5b00-5b91-9578-db3b3f317140")
	)
	(text "J2: type A, through-hole, right angle. Hole pattern of Molex 67643,\nStewart SS-52100-001, Kycon KUSBX-AS1N, Connfly DS1095.\n1 VBUS, 2 D-, 3 D+, 4 GND, shell to GND."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 304.8 193.04 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
				(italic yes)
				(color 70 70 70 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "8ac0277d-ce93-5cd0-9d7e-019bd685c59f")
	)
	(text "J3: 2x5, 2.54 mm, PC internal USB pinout.\n1, 2 VBUS_PORT; 3 D-; 5 D+; 7, 8 GND.\n9 is the key (pin absent). 4, 6 (a second port's data)\nand 10 (over-current sense on a PC): not connected.\nA slot bracket's first socket works, its second has\npower only. A 1x4 cable fits the odd row."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 383.54 193.04 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
				(italic yes)
