	(text "DIY build (default variant): U1, M1, D1, F1, C1, C2, Q1, R1, J2 or J3.\nOptional: M2 (microSD), M3 (DAC).\nU2, C3, C4 fitted (3V3_AUX regulator; JP2 open). Not fitted (DNP): J4\n(developers), J5 (recovery).\nJLC build (variant JLC): the SMD parts of block 11 instead of D1, F1, C1-C4,\nQ1, R1, U2 and M2; modules, headers and J2 or J3 by hand.\nNo pull-up on SD_CS (GPIO18).\nBus signals only on GPIO0-38 (5 V tolerant); GPIO39-47 never see the bus.\nJ1 70 (/LDS) is not connected on this board."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 456.12 165.72 0)
		(effects
