	(text "M1 is fitted. RSTn stays open: the module has its own power-on reset\n(10k, 100 nF, 1N4148) and the firmware resets the W5500 in software.\nThe module has 10k pull-ups on SCSn and INTn, so the W5500 is deselected\nwhile the RP2350 is in reset. INTn shares GPIO39 with the module's LED1.\n3.3V from 3V3_AUX: U2 (default) or, without U2, the module LDO\nthrough JP2 (132 mA typical).\nSeated about 17.8 mm above the PCB on its header plastic (the W5500 sits\non the module's underside). The adjacent slot on its side must stay empty."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 119.38 264.16 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
				(italic yes)
				(color 70 70 70 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "99605c48-515c-5275-a16f-387c51c96943")
	)
