	(text "M2 is optional. No pull-up on the chip select: GPIO18 resets with its pull-down\non (50-80k), which selects the card while the RP2350 is in reset; nothing is\nclocked then, and the firmware drives CS high as soon as it has configured its\nGPIOs, before it uses SPI1. The breakout carries four 10k pull-ups of its own,\non lines not identified.\nSPI1 sharing with M1 is a firmware matter: one byte with both chip selects high\nbefore the W5500 is selected; the card is initialised before network traffic."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 208.28 299.72 0)
		(effects
			(font
