	(text "BOOTSEL"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 550.94 276.86 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
				(color 90 90 90 1)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "6ca75224-f381-5374-bc73-994ecbeeff5d")
	)
	(text "J4: SWD for developers, SWCLK (P2.10), GND, SWDIO (P2.6);\ndebug log over RTT (no UART on this board).\nJ5: RUN (P2.11), GND, BOOTSEL (P2.5). RUN to GND resets the card;\nwith BOOTSEL held to GND the RP2350 starts its USB bootloader.\nThe module's FPC adapter has both as buttons."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 457.2 294.64 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
				(italic yes)
				(color 70 70 70 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "fdb8af91-fc7c-51a2-b264-ab2ce3be2b71")
	)
	(text "11a. JLC build: SMD alternates of the power and interrupt parts"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 17.74 337.78 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2.8 2.8)
				(bold yes)
				(color 210 30 30 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "e8668aa4-72e6-546c-9fc1-64b8b62f1780")
	)
	(text "Same nets as the through-hole part: D101 = D1 (SMD), C101-C103 = C1 (SMD), ... (number x 100 + n). The DIY build fits the\nthrough-hole parts (default variant), the JLC build these (variant JLC). Never both: the pads share the footprint area."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 17.74 342.88 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
				(italic yes)
				(color 210 30 30 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "4e30a343-a3a9-508e-bee1-193a4617e02e")
	)
	(text "U201: tab = VOUT, as U2. R6 in series with C401 gives the\n22 uF MLCC the ESR of the tantalum the AMS1117 data\nsheet is written for."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 116.84 365.76 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
				(italic yes)
				(color 70 70 70 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "836e9be1-0cb4-52ad-b0f8-81ac1ad5c6ac")
	)
	(text "C101-C103: bulk on the bus +5V (C1). C201-C205: port bulk (C2).\n22 uF 25 V X5R 1206, 13.6 uF each at 5 V."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 182.88 370.84 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
				(italic yes)
				(color 70 70 70 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "4cdcb630-cfa1-51cb-a569-844321f83edc")
	)
	(text "Q101 SOT-23: 1 B, 2 E, 3 C (Q1 TO-92: 1 E, 2 B, 3 C)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 269.24 375.92 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
				(italic yes)
				(color 70 70 70 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "270848f8-3078-5868-9d3c-68d8b4e7588f")
	)
	(text "11b. JLC build: microSD socket J6 (replaces M2)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 342.86 337.78 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2.8 2.8)
				(bold yes)
				(color 150 90 0 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "1853a0dd-b517-51e3-a482-a0b5ddda1bf0")
	)
	(text "Hirose DM3AT-SF-PEJM5, push-push, under M2's outline, card detect open. CS = DAT3, MOSI = CMD, MISO = DAT0."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 342.86 342.88 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
				(italic yes)
				(color 150 90 0 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "3350d58d-de04-5c62-b430-4c39ce031120")
	)
	(text "Pull-ups, none on CS (as M2):\nR2 DAT2, R3 CMD (MOSI), R4 DAT0 (MISO),\nR5 DAT1: 10k to 3V3_AUX.\nC5 100 nF + C6 10 uF at the socket's VDD.\nDET_A / DET_B (9, 10) open.\nM2 (breakout) and J6 are never both fitted."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 508 355.6 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
				(italic yes)
				(color 70 70 70 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "14a4461e-1d3a-5dbe-813a-eb22cba05578")
	)
